  in `values-<language>` (German: `values-de`); TranslationsTest checks that
  each has every text, with the same placeholders.

  The UI tests find buttons and menu items by these texts, and the unit tests
  read this file (EnglishTexts.kt): change a text and its tests change too.
-->
